  "Q00617_GatherTheFlames/32049-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00617_GatherTheFlames/32049-02.html",
   "quest": 617,
   "text": "Blacksmith of Wind Rooney: Um, look here. You have a lot of Flames here! If you give me 1200 Flames, I will exchange them for the S-Grade weapon recipe. I am taking more than Vulcan? Well, this recipe contains my effort, sweat and blood, so I can't take any less...",
