   "text": "Blacksmith of Wind Rooney: What interesting research! I tried various things with the fragments, and was able to make a totem containing the power of the dragons. The effect differs, depending on how the fragments are combined. There is also a problem with range of output, so it can only be used wh…",
   "header": "Blacksmith of Wind Rooney",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 2; !gotAllQuestItems(st)"
   ],
